  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/C1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. scripts/smart-test:1449-1458 is the only whole-tree union (CONFIDENCE_GATE_TEST); no meta_key string in smart-test; 33 core tests compute REPO_ROOT = parents[3] and read producers by path. Committed manifests of analyzer-only commits after filing: 2e78e70d27 (11-01, kotlin) test_meta_key_coherence 0 / test_confidence_sites 1; cd93704544 0/1; cdddef709a 0; 7b57c9137c 0. smart-test last changed e98c083991 (unrelated). MECHANISM: a path-read whole-tree gate is invisible to the import-graph reverse slice; smart-test unions such gates only through a hand-written per-gate block. ROOT-CAUSE GROUP: hand-maintained cross-references with no mechanical check (with INV-fogul's 'no slice selects the guarding test', WI-kitij, META-jotob). Status unchanged."  # fc51
